import Link from"next/link";import{db}from"@/lib/db";import{categoryLabel}from"@/lib/i18n";import{getLocale,getMessages}from"@/lib/i18n-server";export const dynamic="force-dynamic";export default async function Categories(){const[cats,locale,m]=await Promise.all([db.category.findMany({where:{isActive:true},include:{_count:{select:{artworks:{where:{status:"PUBLISHED"}}}}}}),getLocale(),getMessages()]);return <section className="section"><span className="eyebrow">{m.collections}</span><h1>{m.categories}</h1><div className="category-grid">{cats.map(c=>{const x=categoryLabel(c.slug,locale,c);return <Link href={`/categories/${c.slug}`} key={c.id}><span>{c._count.artworks} {m.works}</span><h2>{x.name}</h2><p>{x.description}</p></Link>})}</div></section>}